<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Minjine's 음성 안내시스템 - TTS 방송 시스템</title>
    
    <!-- ResponsiveVoice.js for additional TTS voices -->
    <script src="https://code.responsivevoice.org/responsivevoice.js?key=demo"></script>
    
    <!-- Font Awesome for Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        :root {
            --primary-color: #FF6B9D;
            --secondary-color: #C66BFF;
            --accent-color: #66D9FF;
            --background-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            --card-gradient: linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff, #f3f4f6);
            --text-dark: #2D3436;
            --text-light: #636E72;
            --success: #00B894;
            --danger: #FF7675;
            --warning: #FDCB6E;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFE5EC 0%, #E8D5FF 50%, #D5F4FF 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            position: relative;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }
        
        /* 배경 애니메이션 */
        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: fixed;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='60' height='60' viewBox='0 0 60 60' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cg fill='%23ff6b9d' fill-opacity='0.05'%3E%3Cpath d='M36 34v-4h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2h-4zm0-30V0h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2V6h4V4h-4zM6 34v-4H4v4H0v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2H6zM6 4V0H4v4H0v2h4v4h2V6h4V4H6z'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E") repeat;
            animation: backgroundMove 20s linear infinite;
            z-index: -1;
        }
        
        @keyframes backgroundMove {
            0% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
            100% { transform: translate(-30px, -30px); }
        }
        
        /* 상단 경고 배너 */
        .warning-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #FF6B6B, #C44569);
            color: white;
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(196, 69, 105, 0.3);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .warning-banner::before {
            content: '⚠️';
            position: absolute;
            left: 20px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            font-size: 24px;
            animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;
        }
        
        .warning-banner::after {
            content: '⚠️';
            position: absolute;
            right: 20px;
            top: 50%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            font-size: 24px;
            animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;
        }
        
        /* 회사 정보 헤더 */
        .company-header {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            border-bottom: 3px solid var(--primary-color);
        }
        
        .company-info {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        
        .company-logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }
        
        .logo-text {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 800;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-color), var(--secondary-color));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        
        .creator-info {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa, #c3cfe2);
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }
        
        /* 소셜 링크 섹션 */
        .social-links {
            background: white;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            max-width: 1200px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        
        .social-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(120px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
        
        .social-item {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 15px;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff, #f0f0f0);
            border-radius: 15px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .social-item::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,107,157,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
            transform: scale(0);
            transition: transform 0.5s;
        }
        
        .social-item:hover::before {
            transform: scale(1);
        }
        
        .social-item:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.05);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        
        .social-icon {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 24px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-color), var(--secondary-color));
            color: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        
        .social-item:hover .social-icon {
            transform: rotateY(360deg);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(255,107,157,0.4);
        }
        
        .social-name {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        /* 메인 컨테이너 */
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        
        /* 메인 타이틀 */
        .main-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .main-title h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            font-weight: 800;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF6B9D, #C66BFF, #66D9FF);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            display: inline-block;
            position: relative;
            animation: titleFloat 3s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        
        @keyframes titleFloat {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
        }
        
        .subtitle {
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        
        /* 카드 스타일 */
        .card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 25px;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        
        .card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 5px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary-color), var(--secondary-color), var(--accent-color));
        }
        
        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }
        
        .card-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            padding-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #f0f0f0;
        }
        
        .card-icon {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-color), var(--secondary-color));
            border-radius: 15px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 24px;
            color: white;
            margin-right: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(255,107,157,0.3);
        }
        
        .card-title {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }
        
        /* 음성 선택 스크롤 영역 */
        .voice-selector {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            max-height: 400px;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }
        
        .voice-selector::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 10px;
        }
        
        .voice-selector::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #f1f1f1;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        
        .voice-selector::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-color), var(--secondary-color));
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        
        .voice-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            border: 3px solid transparent;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }
        
        .voice-card:hover {
            transform: translateX(10px);
            border-color: var(--primary-color);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(255,107,157,0.2);
        }
        
        .voice-card.selected {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFE5EC, #F3E5FF);
            border-color: var(--secondary-color);
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
        
        .voice-avatar {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-color), var(--secondary-color));
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            font-size: 24px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        
        .voice-info {
            flex: 1;
        }
        
        .voice-name {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        
        .voice-lang {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-color), #4FC3F7);
            color: white;
            padding: 3px 10px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }
        
        .voice-description {
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }
        
        /* 입력 필드 스타일 */
        .input-group {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .input-group label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        
        .input-group textarea,
        .input-group input[type="text"],
        .input-group input[type="time"],
        .input-group select {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 15px;
            border: 2px solid #f0f0f0;
            border-radius: 15px;
            font-size: 14px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            background: white;
        }
        
        .input-group textarea:focus,
        .input-group input:focus,
        .input-group select:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--primary-color);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(255,107,157,0.1);
        }
        
        .input-group textarea {
            min-height: 120px;
            resize: vertical;
            font-family: inherit;
        }
        
        /* 슬라이더 스타일 */
        .slider-control {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        
        .slider-control input[type="range"] {
            flex: 1;
            -webkit-appearance: none;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--primary-color) 0%, var(--secondary-color) 100%);
            outline: none;
        }
        
        .slider-control input[type="range"]::-webkit-slider-thumb {
            -webkit-appearance: none;
            appearance: none;
            width: 25px;
            height: 25px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: white;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        
        .slider-control input[type="range"]::-webkit-slider-thumb:hover {
            transform: scale(1.2);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(255,107,157,0.4);
        }
        
        .slider-value {
            min-width: 60px;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--primary-color);
            font-size: 16px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFE5EC, #F3E5FF);
            padding: 5px 10px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        
        /* 버튼 스타일 */
        .btn {
            padding: 15px 30px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 15px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            margin: 5px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        
        .btn::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            width: 0;
            height: 0;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            transition: width 0.6s, height 0.6s;
        }
        
        .btn:hover::before {
            width: 300px;
            height: 300px;
        }
        
        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-color), var(--secondary-color));
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(255,107,157,0.3);
        }
        
        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(255,107,157,0.4);
        }
        
        .btn-success {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--success), #00CEC9);
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,184,148,0.3);
        }
        
        .btn-success:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,184,148,0.4);
        }
        
        .btn-warning {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--warning), #FECA57);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(253,203,110,0.3);
        }
        
        .btn-warning:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(253,203,110,0.4);
        }
        
        .btn-danger {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--danger), #EE5A24);
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(255,118,117,0.3);
        }
        
        .btn-danger:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(255,118,117,0.4);
        }
        
        .btn-small {
            padding: 8px 16px;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        
        /* 예약 아이템 */
        .schedule-item {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8f9fa, #e9ecef);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-left: 5px solid var(--primary-color);
            position: relative;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        
        .schedule-item:hover {
            transform: translateX(10px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        
        .schedule-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        
        .schedule-time {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--primary-color);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        
        .status-indicator {
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        
        .status-waiting {
            background: var(--warning);
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }
        
        .status-active {
            background: var(--success);
            animation: pulse 1s infinite;
        }
        
        .status-completed {
            background: var(--text-light);
        }
        
        @keyframes pulse {
            0% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
            50% { opacity: 0.7; transform: scale(1.2); }
            100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
        }
        
        /* 저장된 음성 아이템 */
        .saved-audio-item {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            transition: all 0.3s;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .saved-audio-item::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary-color), var(--secondary-color));
        }
        
        .saved-audio-item:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }
        
        .saved-audio-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        
        .saved-audio-icon {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-color), var(--secondary-color));
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            font-size: 24px;
        }
        
        .saved-audio-info {
            flex: 1;
        }
        
        .saved-audio-title {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        
        .saved-audio-date {
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        
        .saved-audio-controls {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
        
        .schedule-input-group {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            align-items: center;
            margin-top: 10px;
            padding: 10px;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        
        .schedule-input-group input[type="time"] {
            padding: 8px;
            border: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        
        /* 토스트 메시지 */
        .toast {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 30px;
            right: 30px;
            background: var(--text-dark);
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 25px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(20px);
            transition: all 0.3s;
            z-index: 10000;
            max-width: 300px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }
        
        .toast.show {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }
        
        .toast.success {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--success), #00CEC9);
        }
        
        .toast.error {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--danger), #EE5A24);
        }
        
        .toast.info {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-color), var(--secondary-color));
        }
        
        /* YouTube 플레이어 */
        .youtube-container {
            position: relative;
            padding-bottom: 56.25%;
            height: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }
        
        .youtube-container iframe {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }
        
        /* 그리드 레이아웃 */
        .main-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .main-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            
            .social-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(100px, 1fr));
            }
            
            .main-title h1 {
                font-size: 32px;
            }
        }
        
        .saved-audio-list {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
        }
        
        /* 푸터 */
        .footer {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            margin-top: 50px;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 3px solid var(--primary-color);
            box-shadow: 0 -5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        
        .footer-text {
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
        
        .like-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-color), var(--secondary-color));
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 20px 0;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(255,107,157,0.3);
        }
        
        .like-button:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255,107,157,0.5);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- 저작권 경고 -->
    <div class="warning-banner">
        <strong>📢 저작권 경고: 이 프로그램은 민지네에서 제작한 무료 배포 소프트웨어입니다. 무단 도용 및 상업적 이용을 엄격히 금지합니다!</strong>
    </div>

    <!-- 회사 헤더 -->
    <div class="company-header">
        <div class="company-info">
            <div class="company-logo">
                <div class="logo-text">Minjine's</div>
            </div>
            <div class="creator-info">
                <strong>제작: 서교민 (민지네 대표)</strong> | 코인 분석기 제작 전문
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 사업 분야 & SNS 링크 -->
    <div class="social-links">
